Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: lsw
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         qemu-system-x86 (>= 1:8.2), qemu-system-modules-opengl, ovmf, swtpm,
         swtpm-tools, passt, virtiofsd, uidmap, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: pipewire
Description: Linux Subsystem for Windows: Windows 11 apps on the Linux desktop
 LSW runs Windows 11 in a KVM virtual machine and shows its apps as native
 Linux windows (Coherence), in a window, or full screen. It installs
 Windows unattended, shares your Desktop/Documents/Downloads/Pictures/
 Music/Videos folders, syncs the clipboard, plays sound through PipeWire,
 passes USB devices through, and adds every Windows app to the app grid.
